# Family on main root, work in HX

`main` 根目錄 = **家庭**。`HX/` = **工作**。

- 家庭頁：根目錄 `物品清單.html`、`todo.html`
- 工作檔：只放入 `HX/`
- 唔好再開 `家庭/` folder
- 唔好把呢兩頁再複製去其他 branch
- After every local HX / repo update that should live on GitHub, **commit and `git push` immediately** (same turn). Do not leave work only on this PC. If several versions were never pushed, **push the latest** (one commit of current state is enough — do not invent one commit per missed version). Do not push secrets (`.env`, passwords, credentials). Do not force-push. Do not skip hooks unless the user asked.
- 每次本機更新（應上 GitHub 嘅 HX／倉資料）**即刻 commit + push `main`**，唔好只留喺呢部機。之前漏咗就 **push 而家最新**（一次 commit 夠）。
- **暗號 bye / 收工：** 用戶收工返屋企。即刻 `commit + push` 所有本機應上 GitHub 嘅野，**包 Status / actions**（`HX/team-board-actions.json`）。唔 force；唔 push 秘密。Status 只喺 browser 而未 auto-push 嘅要講清楚。唔開新 Chrome。
- HTML 右下角 version：細改 +0.1，大改 +1.0；改完**必改**右下角
- After an HX update, **do not open a new browser / Chrome**. Tell the user the **page version number(s)** in the chat. The user will **manually refresh** the tab they already have.
- HX screen chrome uses the HAECO mark colours: deep teal `#015260`, teal `#00778b`, bright teal `#00a8ad`. Status red, green, and amber stay.
- **English-only pages:** `hx.html#links` / `#flow` / `#training` / `#auth-list` / `#lic-records` / `#audit` / `#team-board` / `#courses` / `#sections` / `#ocg-pax` / `#brs` (old `#ke-rs` aliases to `#brs`; board + printable record + dashboard on one page) and those HTML files must be English UI. Staff Chinese names stay. Not this rule: `#docs` / `#tooling` / `#fth-rewrite` / `#scratch` / `#rules`.
- 改完 HX **唔好開新 browser / Chrome**。喺對話講 **version 號** 就得；用戶自己 refresh 已開嘅 tab。
- 跨機額外規矩：`HX/hx-rules.html`（紅字＝新加，另一部機要對齊）

# HX name-list rules stay in sync

Whenever a **name-list / PAX / CG / role / staff #** rule changes, review **every** `HX/` page that uses staff data or those labels — not only the page you are editing.

Must stay aligned:

- `HX/hx.html` — titles, blurbs, cache-bust `?v=`
- `HX/ocg-pax-mechanics-list.html` — Crew List / Name List / Full List (source of truth)
- `HX/training-team-board.html` — Training One View: combined UAL CBT / CT Reminder / Mandatory; filters OCG / CG / PAX; roster from Name List
- `HX/authorization-list.html` — QA Authorization List; Name List people; staff # 6 digits
- `HX/lic-records.html` — License Records; Name List CG/PAX; staff # 6 digits
- `HX/README.md` and `HX/links.html` — names and wording
- 出街顯示 vs 背底：見 `hx-published-vs-backend.mdc`（只改邏輯；有 Team／Shift／session 出入要先講）

Current rules:

- Staff # always **6 digits** (`84096` → `084096`)
- CHIU SHI HEI is **303173**
- **OCG** = **CG + PAX** (the total / All). Not a person-level category. Counters and filters: **OCG | CG | PAX**
- A person is **CG** or **PAX** only. Column label **CG/PAX**; never show OCG on a row
- **PAX** = Crew List, including **FLS** and **RF**
- **CG** (not OC) = Name List people not on Crew List
- **Certifiers** = Licensed Engineer / Assistant Licensed Engineer / Controller / Duty in Charge (including Deputy DIC and OCG PAX / CARGO / UPS DIC)
- **Mechanics** = AMM, technician, refueller, Supervisor
- **Office** = Manager / Assistant Manager / support / liaison / project officer / operations officer — not Controller, not Duty in Charge
- **Ingest reject (no silent skip):** If the designed parser cannot recognize a row or cannot complete a required step, **popup and reject the entire file**. Do not skip unknown rows and still update. User must fix the source (or the parser / `CODE_RE`) first. Examples: unknown staff (UAL), unknown course code, missing usual columns, unreadable file.
- 認唔到或做唔到必要步驟 → 彈窗、整份檔 REJECT、唔寫入。唔好跳過認唔到嘅行仲 UPDATE。UAL OCG Functional Area only：LM OCG AV / LM OCG PAX AF / LM OCG AF / LM OCG Management（同 LM OCG / LMOCG / LMOC）。**145 & OCG Planning = PLANNING**，唔係 OCG 人；Planning staff 唔喺 Name List 唔 reject。真正 OCG 人唔喺 Name List → 彈窗；OK 唔寫入；橙色 Override 確認問題後只入 Name List 嘅 OCG 行。唔識 course code／檔壞／0 個 OCG 行 → 硬 reject。UAL 回覆串：最上封最新；要 `From:` 下一行 `Sent:` 先切開（唔好單憑 From:），忽略舊 trail。人名彈窗 2–6 可 Override；檔壞／唔識 code／invalid #（7）硬 reject。我哋 OCG：AV / PAX AF / AF / Management。CGO AF 當 AF，Name List 有就唔彈。Refueller 彈、唔入。UAL Home/Current 係 LTA* 但又唔喺 Name List → CXG（LTA1–4 嘅 A/B/C/D），自動 filter，唔當 unknown staff。OCG LTA 係 E/F/G（同 FLS／RF）；LTA6 A–D 先係我哋。CT／Mandatory 全 LM export：Transit／非 OCG 唔當 reject（板面之後 filter）。Typo 只喺名一樣或調轉、而且 # 差少少（差 1 粒或 123456 vs 123564 調位）先彈。# 相近但名唔同＝兩個正常人。板面中 Name List 先顯示。認唔到 staff # 或冇 course code 先 reject 整份。Add course：staff 唔喺 Name List → 彈窗、唔加。
- **Override still marks problems:** After Override, flagged people and courses stay marked (orange **OV** + flag list). Not imported people stay on the list. Clean ingest of that source clears its flags.
- **Team Board Status / actions stay:** Immediate Status / Remark / Manual stay in this browser. No daily **Keep Status** click. Auto-push reads `localStorage` (`hx:team-board:gh-token`) if already set — never in the page / repo; the page does not show a token field. Each Status / Remark / Manual change auto-saves (~800ms) and auto-PUTs `HX/team-board-actions.json` (GET sha then PUT, 1–2s debounce). Quiet success; popup only on push failure. Remark is stored with Status (staff # + course + source).
- **Briefing / Read & Sign · PIN:** Seen/Sign with per-staff 6-digit PIN (first default = staff #, then force change ≠ staff #; wrong PIN does not ack). Allowed on Briefing & Read & Sign page **and** on Training One View outstanding Sign/Seen. Status stays Complete / Not started only (no dropdown write). BRS page is a TOV-style summary (one row per item, click to open detail); Admin create/edit/PIN vault only when edit unlock (not in DOM for view-only). Hashes in locked `hx_private.brs_staff_pin` via Edge `team-board` `/pin/*`. Full text: `HX/hx-rules.html`.
- **Missing emails:** Staff lists not in `QA_Auth_Full_Detailed_List.csv` (e.g. CXG / One TRT) → free-text `staff#@haeco.com` only; leave Email blank until real display-name emails are pasted. Keep duplicate auth rows. Full text: `HX/hx-rules.html` / `hx-rules-html.mdc`.
- **Auth / Lic · Name List only (CSV dept reference):** On Authorization List and License Records, CSV Department is reference only — not the displayed Section/Team. Displayed staff #, Section, and Team come from the Name List roster. People not on the Name List must not appear in the HTML table or on-screen counters; keep them in packed `stage` (compact, lossless CSV fields). Keep packed format for speed; do not drop real fields; data must stay accurate. Full text: `HX/hx-rules.html`.
